{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里也还不踏实，却决定往前，重新有了劲。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新有了劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己每一步都得见效，因为尽力也未必护得住想要的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"每一步都得见效\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他承认自己怕争取会伤到那种亲近安稳的生活，还是舍不得放下这个盼头。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得放下\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想护住这样的日子，愿意接下眼前的难事。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住这样的日子\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"text\": \"真要付出时，他还是会迟疑一下，却没有因此停下。\",\n      \"key\": \"迟疑一下\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并、改写\",\n      \"why\": \"S12-1保留仍不踏实却决定前行、重新有劲；S12-4说明这次行动是为了护住向往的日子。删去与上一段重复的少伤办法前提。删除S01-4、S02-1、S02-2到S12-1的弱箭头，改由S11-1、S11-6支撑这次前行。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不要求每分努力证明自己能改变一切，落到不再逼自己每一步都得见效。S11-2说明行动不能消除牵挂，S11-3说明向往的日子仍受威胁。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象地说两边都能摆明，改成具体承认争取可能伤到亲近安稳的生活，仍舍不得放下这个盼头；S11-4中的顾虑仍在起作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把责任宣言落到想护住向往的日子，所以愿意接下眼前的难事。删除S05-3到S12-4的箭头，改由S11-3、S11-4提供真正的行动动机。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足、收紧\",\n      \"why\": \"补出付出时的短暂迟疑及没有停下；删去与S12-4重复的继续做眼前该做的事。将S11-4到S12-5的弱箭头换成S11-5，因为S11-5直接写出想到付出会心疼、迟疑至今仍没找到别路。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "966569d0-420f-43e7-9645-1e73f813b219", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T110209147044Z", "elapsed_seconds": 613.704, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:12:22.858689+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ba46646a4615caf1da6f5cba6ac0d75eb545d62b08e5f8463610fff9b2ac563", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_m